@startuml
!theme plain

skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif

title Python → C++ MCTS 完整调用链路

participant "训练脚本\n(mcts_self_play.py)" as Script
participant "PolicyValueAiEngine\n(Python)" as Engine
participant "CppMctsAdapter\n(Python)" as Adapter
participant "MctsSearcher\n(C++ pybind11)" as Searcher
participant "NeuralNet\n(C++)" as NN
participant "LibTorch / GPU" as GPU

== 引擎初始化 ==

Script -> Engine: ① create_engine("cnn_v11")
Engine -> Adapter: ② CppMctsAdapter(model_path, ...)
Adapter -> Searcher: ③ new MctsSearcher(...)
note right of Searcher
    加载 TorchScript 模型
    启动 N 个 MCTS 线程
    启动 1 个 GPU 推理线程
end note

== 每步落子决策 ==

Script -> Engine: ④ get_move(board, current_player, "sampling")
Engine -> Engine: ⑤ board_to_vector → 226 维状态
Engine -> Adapter: ⑥ search(state)
Adapter -> Searcher: ⑦ search(state)
note right of Searcher
    N 线程并行 MCTS × num_simulations 次
    每次 simulation: Select → GPU Eval → Backup
end note
Searcher --> Adapter: ⑧ MctsResult
note right: (visit_counts, root_value, root_policy)
Adapter --> Engine: ⑨ (visit_counts, root_value, root_policy)

Engine -> Engine: ⑩ 温度采样选择 action
Engine -> Engine: ⑪ action → (x, y) 坐标
Engine --> Script: ⑫ MoveDecision(x, y, mcts_visit_counts)

== 子树复用 ==

Script -> Engine: ⑬ after_move(x, y)
Engine -> Adapter: ⑭ advance_root(x * 15 + y)
Adapter -> Searcher: ⑮ advance_root(action)
note right of Searcher
    提升子节点为新根
    释放兄弟子树
end note
Searcher --> Adapter: ⑯ bool (成功/失败)
Adapter --> Engine: ⑰ bool

== 循环至对局结束 ==

loop 直至终局
    Script -> Engine: ④ get_move(...)
    Engine -> Engine: ⑤-⑥-⑦-⑧-⑨
    Engine -> Engine: ⑩-⑪-⑫ 落子 + ⑬-⑰ 复用
end

@enduml
